cos(t/2) = 1/2 ; sin(t/2) n = (1/2, 1/2, 1/2) ; angle t = 2/3*pi ; axis n = (1/3*sqrt(3), 1/3*sqrt(3), 1/3*sqrt(3))
eigenvalues of g: [1/2*I*sqrt(3) + 1/2, -1/2*I*sqrt(3) + 1/2] ; e^{-i t/2} = -1/2*I*sqrt(3) + 1/2
axis xi^dagger sigma xi from the eigenvector of e^{-i t/2}: [sqrt(1/3), sqrt(1/3), sqrt(1/3)]
